// Prompter Studio — схема данных (владение: агент 2-c)
// Сценарий → секции (порядок), дубли (takes), токены подключения телефона.

generator client {
  provider = "prisma-client-js"
}

datasource db {
  provider = "sqlite"
  url      = env("DATABASE_URL")
}

model Script {
  id         String      @id @default(cuid())
  title      String      @default("Новый сценарий")
  revision   Int         @default(1)
  createdAt  DateTime    @default(now())
  updatedAt  DateTime    @updatedAt
  sections   Section[]
  takes      Take[]
  pairTokens PairToken[]
}

model Section {
  id         String   @id @default(cuid())
  scriptId   String
  script     Script   @relation(fields: [scriptId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  orderIndex Int
  title      String   @default("")
  content    String   @default("")
  color      String   @default("default")
  createdAt  DateTime @default(now())
  updatedAt  DateTime @updatedAt

  @@index([scriptId, orderIndex])
}

model Take {
  id           String   @id @default(cuid())
  scriptId     String
  script       Script   @relation(fields: [scriptId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  sectionId    String
  sectionTitle String
  t0           Int
  t1           Int
  durationMs   Int
  rating       String?
  createdAt    DateTime @default(now())

  @@index([scriptId, createdAt])
}

model PairToken {
  id         String    @id @default(cuid())
  token      String    @unique
  scriptId   String
  script     Script    @relation(fields: [scriptId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  deviceName String?
  createdAt  DateTime  @default(now())
  expiresAt  DateTime
  usedAt     DateTime?

  @@index([scriptId])
}
